==Trivia==
===In-Universe===

*His birthday is given in the reboot as '''March 11;'''<ref name="narfday"/> he shares this date with his voice actor, [[Rob Paulsen]].
*Pinky knows all the lyrics to "[[Yakko's World (song)|Yakko's World]];"<ref name="third mouse">[[Episode 13 (PATB): The Third Mouse/The Visit]]</ref><ref name="squeeze play">[[Squeeze Play]]</ref> this is likely another voice actor-related in-joke, as Rob Paulsen also voices [[Yakko Warner]].
*Pinky appears to be somewhat ambidextrous. In some cartoons, he is seen writing with his right hand while in others such as “[[No Brainer]]”, he is shown writing with his left hand. The [[Super7]] ''Animaniacs Ultimates'' figure of Pinky also features him with a pen in his left hand.

===General===

*Pinky is modeled after [https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0280222/ Eddie Fitzgerald], a writer and director for ''[[Tiny Toon Adventures]].''
**When [[Tom Ruegger]] was working for ''Tiny Toons,'' his office was next to Fitzgerald and Tom Minton's, and he would often overhear their conversations. Minton would talk in a low voice and Fitzgerald would often randomly interject with words like "NARF!" and "EGAD!"
**In one episode of ''Tiny Toons,'' Fitzgerald was credited as "Guy who says 'Narf'".
*When asked to describe Pinky in one word, Rob Paulsen referred to him as "Narfy."<ref name="" narfy''="">[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CsdksMNOxEw ANIMANIACS cast Q&A + SAT, JAN 16TH (2021) | 1PM PT, 4PM ET]</ref>
*{{w|WatchMojo}} picked Pinky for the #6 spot in their "Top 10 Dumbest Animated TV Characters" list.<ref>Butler, C. (2014) ''Top 10 Dumbest Animated TV Characters'', ''WatchMojo''. Available at: https://watchmojo.com/articles/top-10-dumbest-animated-tv-characters (Accessed: March 5, 2023).</ref>
**Following behind [[w:c:ed:Ed|Ed]] from ''[[w:c:Ed, Edd n Eddy (TV Series)|Ed, Edd n Eddy]]'' (#5), [[w:c:grimadventures:Billy|Billy]] from ''[[w:c:grimadventures:The Grim_Adventures of Billy & Mandy|The Grim Adventures of Billy & Mandy]]'' (#4), [[w:c:familyguy:Chris Griffin|Chris Griffin]] from ''[[w:c:familyguy:Family Guy|Family Guy]]'' (#3), [[w:c:simpsons:Ralph Wiggum|Ralph Wiggum]] from ''[[w:c:simpsons:The Simpsons|The Simpsons]]'' (#2), & [[w:c:spongebob:Patrick Star|Patrick Star]] from ''[[w:c:spongebob:SpongeBob SquarePants (series)|SpongeBob SquarePants]]'' (#1).

